<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it raised its recommendation on Tellabs Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- The change was based in part on the company's announcement of quarterly earnings that exceeded security analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade, Tellabs stock rose to a new year-high 80-1/4 from 73, then eased to trade up 5-1/2 at 78-1/2.</p>
</text>
